## Summary

**`src/lib.rs`** — added public function:
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes
        .iter()
        .filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag))
        .collect()
}
```
Exact-match check (`t == tag`), order preserved by iterating `notes` in order.

**`src/main.rs`** — the `list` command now parses an optional `--tag <TAG>` flag from the remaining args and routes output through `notekeep::filter_by_tag` when present (otherwise lists all notes).

